  "id": "tranylcypromine",
  "term": "tranylcypromine",
  "definition": "Tranylcypromine is an orally active drug with antidepressant and anti-anxiety effects. It works mainly by irreversibly blocking monoamine oxidase, which raises levels of serotonin, norepinephrine, epinephrine, and dopamine; it also inhibits LSD1, a target being studied for possible anticancer effects.",
